          "Download white\u2011papers, API references, and architecture briefs from each vendor.",
          "Archive versioned pricing tables and SLA PDFs."
        ]
      },
      {
        "step": "Performance Testing",
        "actions": [
          "Deploy reference implementations in a neutral cloud environment.",
          "Run standardized ANN\u2011Bench queries across scaling tiers (1\u2011node, 4\u2011node, 16\u2011node).",
          "Record p50/p95/p99 latency and max sustainable RPS."
